          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your special connection to death and rebirth allows you to sense when it's your time to enter the Great Beyond, and now isn't the time. You gain +2 status bonus to saving throws against death effects. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Diehard] feat. The first time each day that you lose the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Dying] condition, you do not increase your @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Wounded] condition.</p>"
          },
